Error: invalid metadata schema in /var/folders/yx/0_kwbhm16h3__g0yjwrjgk040000gn/T/tmp.Fb9ctczLy3/schema/metadata/version/1.2.3/en-US.json: json: unknown field "bogusField"
DESCRIPTION
  Validate canonical metadata files (offline by default).

USAGE
  asc metadata validate --dir "./metadata" [--check-urls] [--subscription-app]

Validate canonical metadata files. Validation is offline by default;
--check-urls opts into bounded HTTP checks.

Checks:
  - strict JSON schema decode (unknown keys rejected)
  - required fields
  - metadata character limits
  - URL syntax and length for marketing, support, privacy policy, and privacy choices URLs
  - optional redirect, final-host, status, and site-root checks for support and privacy policy URLs
  - implausibly short app name and description values
  - optional subscription-app Terms of Use / EULA description link heuristic

Examples:
  asc metadata validate --dir "./metadata"
  asc metadata validate --dir "./metadata" --check-urls
  asc metadata validate --dir "./metadata" --subscription-app
  asc metadata validate --dir "./metadata" --output table

FLAGS
  --check-urls   Fetch support and privacy policy URLs to detect redirects and root pages (default: false)
  --dir          Metadata root directory (required)
  --output       Output format: json, table, markdown (default: json)
  --pretty       Pretty-print JSON output (default: false)
  --subscription-app Enable subscription-specific Terms of Use / EULA link checks (default: false)


